WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
Akuma lands as Ryu falls from the heavy-Tatsu juggle.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.150
Standing medium kick misses while Ryu is knocked down.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.550
Akuma catches Ryu with a wake-up forward throw.

4
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.200
Ryu lands in the corner after the throw.
